        "Description": "Your Primary Targets is Docciaborsa, Luca Billione and Renzo Forte, Three key members of the Fortetti Crime family that have been making moves in recent years in Sapienza Italy.\r\rDocciaborsa is in the town to try and pursuade Marco Abiatti to make some adjustments to the plans he has to his campaign, our client, Wishes that the primary targets all be eliminated to send a message to their don.\r\rYou will find Luca and Renzo overviewing the situation from the appartment buildings nearby.\r\rGood luck",
